## Installation

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @akoder/workflow-status
```

## Usage

```tsx
import { WorkflowStatusBadge } from "@/components/ui/workflow-status";

export function DeploymentState() {
  return <WorkflowStatusBadge status="in-progress" />;
}
```

Pass any of the built-in semantic states: `pending`, `in-progress`, `submitted`, `in-review`, `success`, `failed`, or `expired`. Use `label` for product-specific language, or `iconOnly` for compact interface areas.
